# pipeline-variable-removed: `pipeline variable` was removed (PIPEVAR-DEPREC).
#
# The `pipeline variable {list,set,delete}` subcommands were deprecated in
# v1.31.0 in favour of `variable {list,set,delete} --scope repository` and
# removed in v1.40.x. Running the old command must not panic and must
# produce a meaningful message (the pipeline help) showing the available
# subcommands. Use `variable list --scope repository` instead.

# No server needed — unknown-subcommand dispatch is purely local.
bitbottle pipeline variable list
# Cobra prints help for the parent command to stdout; no panic, no empty output.
stdout 'pipeline'
# Confirm 'variable' is absent from the available commands list.
! stdout 'variable'
# Confirm the replacement command is at least hinted via visible subcommands.
stdout 'list'
